{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026ISpPFJO7OL1794474435.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有「長腿女神」之稱的劉穎鏇（Tiffany）向來充滿陽光活力。日前，她在社交平台上載了一段於海濱長廊拍攝的唯美短片，並以英文留言寫道：「wind in my hair and sun on my face 🥰🌞」，盡顯活潑開朗的一面。</p><h3></h3><p>片段中所見，劉穎鏇以休閒且不失時尚的造型亮相。她身穿白色短版長袖上衣，內搭黑色短背心，微微露出纖幼的小蠻腰；下半身則配搭白色高腰闊腳長褲與運動波鞋。這身打扮完美凸顯了她的招牌「逆天長腿」，將其高挑的黃金比例表露無遺。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"70302ae8-58dc-4a19-ab93-bb8357a70749.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20268wCGyrRdpJ1794474435.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"a55a3735-e4f2-49db-a258-9bb80fa223dd.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026QY1LZ4k3NT1794474435.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><h3></h3><p>在金黃色的夕陽映照與海風吹拂下，劉穎鏇的一頭波浪長捲髮隨風飄逸。她一邊在海旁輕快慢跑、轉圈及撥弄秀髮，一邊對著鏡頭展露燦爛甜美的笑容，舉手投足間均散發著滿滿的青春氣息與健康美態，極具感染力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.930701+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:37.872541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:28.648870+00:00","content_hash":"7fd226c4c593d553113f9f2b4d7711a20757c4d64591a87afa98d437b39dbad1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.930701+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}